**Apparatus criticus**  
C = Chaparro Gómez 1985; V = Vat. lat. 629 f. 3v.

§37  
1. ille] Hic V (substitution; H maiuscula in V servata) ;  
2. hic] Hic V (orthographic: capital H) ;  
   autem add. V post Hic (addition) ;  
   genere nobilis] genere nobili V (substitution, morphological/case-ending) ;  
   ortus] ortus est V (addition) ;  
   in] om. V (omission) ;  
3. atrocique] atroque V (substitution, morphological/orthographic) ;  
   extincxit] extinxit V (orthographic) ;
